flowchart LR
    subgraph online[Online deployment: observable information only]
        sensor[LiDAR / odometry / planner status]
        trigger[Failure trigger\npersistent risk, freeze, oscillation,\ndeadlock, planner failure]
        manager[Recovery state machine]
        mask[Planning-guided\naction mask]
        policy[Selected DAgger policy]
        option[Temporary subgoal or\nWAIT / BACKUP / REPLAN / CONTINUE]
        dwb[Nav2 DWB\nnormal controller and execution]
        rejoin[Restore original goal\nand rejoin]
        supervisor[Engineering safety supervisor]
    end

    sensor --> trigger
    trigger -->|normal navigation| dwb
    trigger -->|failure persists| manager
    manager --> mask --> policy --> option --> dwb --> rejoin
    supervisor -.protective intervention.-> dwb

    subgraph training[Offline training only: privileged branch]
        truth[Simulator truth / planning expert]
        labels[Expert recovery labels]
        dataset[BC + DAgger dataset]
    end

    truth -.not a deployed observation.-> labels --> dataset -.trains.-> policy
